**What these patches do:**

1. In **dark.js**, we first import Grommet’s own `grommet` theme and then merge (`...grommet`) all of its defaults into our override.  That way we preserve `theme.select.icons.down` (among many other defaults) rather than clobbering it.  
2. In **Select.js**, we add a fallback so if `theme.select.icons.down` is missing for any reason, the built-in `<FormDown />` icon will be used.  

With these two changes in place, your dark‐mode Select will render its down arrow correctly on a dark background.
